^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
After the cpp11 frontend's std::pair member-function-template fix
(typecheck_compound_body second pass populates template_map with
TYPE-parameter placeholders for constructor templates), main now
contains the std::map operator[] call instead of an empty body, and
the resulting BMC explores enough state in libstdc++ to time out
(when previously this test was a no-op).  Reclassified as KNOWNBUG
pending an STL stub or BMC tuning.
